From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: goat-maintainer <person-30@example.org>
Date: Mon, 16 Jun 2026 00:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] consent: forward identity traits.aff into JWT id_token

The identity grammar (ADR 1043) splits identity into orthogonal dimensions so
capability (the role family, carried in traits.groups) is never named after
affiliation (WHO the identity belongs to). Phase D gives affiliation its own
OIDC claim: traits.aff — an object {id, kind, nation?} mirroring the operator
manifest's affiliation block — must reach the JWT id_token as `aff`, distinct
from `groups`, so a relying party can authorize by affiliation WITHOUT it
leaking into a role/groups check.

The upstream oryd/kratos-selfservice-ui-node consent handler (extractSession in
src/routes/consent.ts) hardcodes a small whitelist of traits to forward, and
patch 0001 added `groups`. This patch adds `aff` the same way: forward
identity.traits.aff verbatim into session.id_token.aff when present and a
non-empty object. Additive only — a no-op for identities that carry no aff
trait (every identity minted before Phase D), so existing logins are unchanged.

Tracked: docs/project/identity-grammar-implementation-plan.md Phase D, ADR 1043,
ADR 0857 (the patched-UI mechanism). Applied at build time by apply-patch.sh
(awk text transform, idempotency marker goat-maintainer-aff-forwarding-patch) and
gate-checked by tests/verify-patched.sh.
---
 src/routes/consent.ts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/routes/consent.ts b/src/routes/consent.ts
index 0000001..0000002 100644
--- a/src/routes/consent.ts
+++ b/src/routes/consent.ts
@@ -63,6 +63,12 @@
     // goat-maintainer/ops/ory-consent patch: forward the groups claim into id_token.
     var __gm = identity.metadata_public || {}, __groups = Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(__gm, "groups") ? __gm.groups : identity.traits.groups
     if (Array.isArray(__groups) && __groups.length > 0) session.id_token.groups = __groups
+
+    // F-572 / ADR 1188: aff lives in admin-managed metadata_public. A migrated
+    // identity (a groups key in metadata_public) never falls back to self-editable traits.
+    // goat-maintainer/ops/ory-consent patch: forward the aff claim into id_token.
+    var __am = identity.metadata_public || {}, __aff = Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(__am, "groups") ? __am.aff : (__am.aff || identity.traits.aff)
+    if (__aff && typeof __aff === "object" && Object.keys(__aff).length > 0) session.id_token.aff = __aff
   }

   if (identity.traits.updated_at) {
--
